    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kurangiza, bene Data, mudusengere kugira ngo Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Umwami bwamamare ningoga kandi ijambo ryiwe ryubahwe nk’uko ryubashwe muri mwebwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudusengere kandi kugira ngo Imana idukize abanyakibi, kuko abantu bose si abizera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Umwami ni umwizigirwa, azobakomeza yongere abarinde wa mubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dufise ukwizera mu Mwami ko mukora kandi ko muzoshishikara mukora ivyo tubahanura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami arongorere imitima yanyu mu rukundo rw’Imana no mu kwihangana kuva kuri Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Data, turabageze mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, ngo mwirinde uwitwa mwene Data wese mugabo w’ikinebwe, atagendera mu nyigisho twabahaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko mwebwe nyene murazi ingene mubwirizwa gukurikira akarorero twabahaye. Ntitwigeze tuba ibinebwe igihe twari kumwe namwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi nta we twigeze turira ivyokurya tutabimuguriye. Ahubwo twakora ijoro n’umurango, tukaruha, tukabira icuya kugira ngo ntihagire uwo turemera muri mwebwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twari dufise uburenganzira bwo gufashwa namwe, ariko ntitwabikoze kuko twashaka kubabera akarorero mwokurikiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’igihe twari kumwe namwe twamye tubaha icagezwe kivuga ngo: “Uwudashaka gukora no kurya ntakarye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twarumvise ko bamwe muri mwebwe ari ibinebwe. Bareka gukora ariko bakita mu bitabaraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bantu turabategetse tubinginga mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo ngo bame bakora kugira ngo babone kwibeshaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe bene Data, ntimukadendebukirwe gukora ineza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitegereze neza uwo wese atumvira ivyo tubabwiye muri rino kete. Mwen’abo mubigire kure kugira ngo bitume bamaramara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimuze mubafate nk’abansi banyu, ariko mubaburire nk’abavukanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami w’amahoro we ubwiwe abahe amahoro ibihe vyose no mu buryo bwose. Umwami abane namwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
